<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mural da Semana - Rádio e TV Nova Cotia</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #001220; /* Azul bem escuro */
            color: white;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .mural-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .video-card {
            background: #002642;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .video-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        video {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 10px;
            outline: none;
        }

        h1 { color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        p { color: #ccc; }
        .instrucao { font-size: 0.9em; color: #00d4ff; margin-top: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <h1>Mural da Semana</h1>
        <p>Rádio e TV Nova Cotia - Conectando a Região</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mural-container">

        <div class="video-card">
            <video controls>
                <source src="URL_DO_SEU_VIDEO_AQUI.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                Seu navegador não suporta vídeos.
            </video>
            <div class="instrucao">🔊 Clique para ouvir</div>
        </div>

        </div>

</body>
</html>
